:"PFOCUS","ticker":"PFOCUS","company":"Prime Focus Limited","event_type":"fund_raise","quantum":"USD 100 mn in aggregate, of which USD 54.36 mn into Brahma AI Holdings","headline":"board clears **Multiples Private Equity subscribing to convertible preference shares of its Brahma AI subsidiaries**, subject to shareholder approval","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/PFOCUS_23092026080956_Reg_30signed.pdf","mcap":27737.8,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/PFOCUS_23092026080956_Reg_30signed.pdf"},{"symbol":"EUROPRATIK","ticker":"EUROPRATIK","company":"Euro Pratik Sales Limited","event_type":"acquisition","quantum":"Rs 42.70 cr including Rs 8.40 cr of fresh capital; ~1.9% of mcap","headline":"board approves buying a **56% controlling stake in Fabwood Solutions, which is to hold the Fab Wood timber and engineered-wood business**, by 8 October","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/EUROPRATIK2025_23092026123645_Outcome.pdf","mcap":2232.6,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/EUROPRATIK2025_23092026123645_Outcome.pdf"},{"symbol":"SUBEXLTD","ticker":"SUBEXLTD","company":"Subex Limited","event_type":"order_win","quantum":"USD 5 mn over five years, extendable by two","headline":"wins a **new-logo engagement with a major Asia-Pacific mobile operator** to run its partner ecosystem mediation, billing, routing and settlement","amount_rs":null,"notability_pct":null,"marquee":null,"marquee_status":null,"pub_dt":null,"pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUBEXLTD_23092026124115_Deal_win_announcement23092026.pdf","mcap":1088.6,"doc":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUBEXLTD_23092026124115_Deal_win_announcement23092026.pdf"}],"themes":{"order_wins":["**Skipper** - secures **fresh orders of Rs 797 crore for domestic and international power transmission and distribution projects**, comprising export orders for transmission towers and monopoles in Australia and a domestic 765 kV transmission line from an unnamed developer _(~12.6% of mcap)_.","**Oswal Pumps** - receives a **Letter of Intent from Telangana Renewable Energy Development Corporation to design, supply and commission 46,705 kW of rooftop solar across 9,937 government schools in 33 districts**, with five years of maintenance; Rs 297.50 crore including GST, Rs 273.19 crore excluding _(~9.5% of mcap)_.","**Subex** - is **chosen by a major Asia-Pacific mobile network operator to modernise its partner ecosystem management**, consolidating voice, messaging, data, 5G and IoT wholesale onto one mediation, billing and settlement platform; USD 5 million over five years, extendable by two.","**Accord Transformer & Switchgear** - reports **cumulative orders of Rs 5.28 crore excluding GST taken since 14 September**, the largest being Rs 4.48 crore of inverter-duty transformers for Good Earth Renewable Services _(~4.0% of mcap)_.","**Oriental Rail Infrastructure** - wins a **Rs 3.64 crore order from Integral Coach Factory, Chennai** to manufacture, supply and install 40 coach sets of chairs, for delivery by 8 November.","**Desco Infratech** - receives a **Rs 2.34 crore purchase order including GST from Adani Total Gas** for MDPE pipeline laying and last-mile connectivity work at Navsari _(~1.6% of mcap)_.","**Fusion Klassroom Edutech** - receives a **Rs 1.35 crore order from an unnamed Bengaluru company to produce educational video content** across artificial intelligence, machine learning, banking and finance courses, running to 31 March 2027."],"fund_raises_fresh_equity":["**Bharat Forge** - closes a **qualified institutions placement of 1,05,82,010 equity shares at Rs 1,890**, a 2.96% discount to the Rs 1,947.70 floor, raising Rs 2,000 crore on our arithmetic; the issue opened on 17 September.","**Prime Focus** - board approves **Multiples Private Equity investing USD 100 million in its material subsidiaries Brahma AI Holdings and Brahma AI Services India** through compulsorily convertible preference shares, USD 54.36 million of it into Brahma AI Holdings, subject to shareholder approval."],"equity_allotments":["**Kalyani Cast-Tech** - allots **3,23,123 convertible warrants at Rs 582 to seven allottees, Rs 18.81 crore**, having received Rs 4.70 crore as the 25% upfront subscription; a fresh preferential allotment, not a conversion _(~2.1% of mcap)_."],"m_and_a":["**Euro Pratik Sales** - board approves acquiring a **56% controlling stake in Fabwood Solutions, which is to own the Fab Wood timber and engineered-wood business, for Rs 42.70 crore** including Rs 8.40 crore of fresh capital, to close by 8 October; Fab Wood turned over Rs 45.25 crore in FY26 _(~1.9% of mcap)_.","**IRB InvIT Fund** - **executes the share purchase agreement to buy 100% of Solapur Yedeshi Tollway and CG Tollway from the sponsor-linked IRB Infrastructure Trust**, a related-party purchase unitholders approved on 3 August; the two road SPVs turned over Rs 306.59 crore between them in FY26.","**Acetech E-Commerce** - signs an **asset purchase agreement with a Sharjah company to buy the lighting and home-decor e-commerce brand Neora-Store outright, for USD 1.8 million**, taking its Shopify storefronts, domains, customer data and intellectual property.","**Lemon Tree Hotels** - receives **no-objection observation letters from both exchanges for its composite scheme of arrangement** folding in Fleur Hotels, Carnation, Hamstede Living and four other group companies, clearing the way to the NCLT.","**Niyogin Fintech** - the **NCLT Chennai allows the first-motion application for its scheme demerging into Niyogin Finserv and amalgamating iServeU Technology**, directing shareholder and creditor meetings and dispensing with three others.","**ICICI Prudential Life Insurance** - the Registrar of Companies **approves its renaming to ICICI Life Insurance Limited** with effect from 22 September, with a fresh certificate of incorporation issued; an application to IRDAI follows."],"capex_core":["**Maxvolt Energy Industries** - holds the **ground-breaking for a proposed 10 GWh lithium battery pack plant at Aligarh**, which its own event material sizes at Rs 700 crore and 1,500 to 2,000 jobs; the plant is proposed, not under construction.","**Orient Green Power** - subsidiary Delta Renewable Energy **commissions 17.60 MW AC (24.64 MW DC) of solar in Thiruvannamalai district**, taking installed solar to 24.6 MW AC and completing the expansion committed under its 2024 rights issue.","**Prostarm Info Systems** - **completes installation and trial runs at relocated facilities and sets a schedule to start operations**, following intimations running back to April."],"credit_rating_changes":["**Salasar Techno Engineering** - **Infomerics places its IVR A and IVR A1 ratings on Watch with Negative Implications** while reaffirming both, across Rs 831.73 crore of bank facilities."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 12 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**Raymond** - subsidiary JK Maini Global Aerospace **emerges successful in a tender from an Indian aerospace and defence OEM to assemble wing and centre-fuselage structures for a major indigenous fighter programme**, its entry into aircraft structures; no value is disclosed and the work is to use the customer's own plant.","**Chandan Healthcare** - reports its **diagnostic franchise network has passed 500 centres, out of 568 in total as of 15 September**, and targets 1,000 by the end of FY27 and 3,000 within two more years; about 80% of the franchises are in Uttar Pradesh."],"distress_risk":["**Sasken Technologies** - the **GST appellate authority in Bengaluru dismisses its appeals for FY21 and FY22 and confirms the demands**, Rs 14.45 crore including recalculated interest for FY21 and Rs 10.90 crore for FY22, on reverse-charge tax.","**Supriya Lifescience** - a court **allows provisional release of a detained 200 kg consignment of ketamine hydrochloride against a Rs 72 lakh deposit**, while expressly leaving adjudication and criminal proceedings under the NDPS Act to continue.","**Sapphire Foods India** - receives a **show-cause notice from the Deputy Commissioner (Commercial Taxes), Chennai**."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"label":"SKIPPER","ticker":"SKIPPER","company":"Skipper Limited","isin":"INE439E01022","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/skipper_23092026104600_Press_ReleaseOrder.pdf","mcap":6340.1},{"label":"OSWALPUMPS","ticker":"OSWALPUMPS","company":"Oswal Pumps Limited","isin":"INE0BYP01024","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/OSWALPUMPS_23092026085715_SELetterTREDCLOrderOPL23092026.pdf","mcap":3119.2},{"label":"SUBEXLTD","ticker":"SUBEXLTD","company":"Subex Limited","isin":"INE754A01055","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/SUBEXLTD_23092026124115_Deal_win_announcement23092026.pdf","mcap":1088.6},{"label":"Accord Transformer & Switchgear Ltd","ticker":"ACCORDTS","company":"Accord Transformer & Switchgear Ltd","isin":"","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/84dda8a9-f9e2-4489-a398-5955f06c0f50.pdf","mcap":132.1},{"mcap":null},{"label":"DESCO","ticker":"DESCO","company":"Desco Infratech Ltd","isin":"INE0TGG01014","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/038d2db2-16ab-4ad8-a7cf-f4de687dc956.pdf","mcap":146.6},{"mcap":null}],"